hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"444","Qabeesa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Salama se, Muslim al Bateen se, Abul Ubaidain se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah se mubazzireen ke bare mein poocha, unhon ne kaha: Wo log jo na haq mein kharch karte hain."
"445","Aarim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husain ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrima se, Ibn Abbas se, mubazzireen ke bare mein, unhon ne kaha: Na haq mein israaf karne wale."
"446","Abdullah bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Umar mimbar par farmaya karte the: Aye logo, apne thikanon ko apne liye durust rakho, aur in jinnon ko khauf zada karo is se pehle ke wo tumhen khauf zada karen, pas beshak un mein ke musalman tumhare samne zahir nahin honge, aur beshak hum Allah ki qasam jab se hum ne un se dushmani ki hai hum ne un se sulah nahin ki."
"447","Abdullah bin Musa ne Israel se, Abu Ishaq se, Harisa bin Mudarrib se, Khabbab se, unhon ne kaha: Beshak aadmi ko har cheez mein ajr diya jata hai siwae imarat ke."
"448","Abu Hafs bin Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Aasim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Wahb Taifi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ghutaif bin Abi Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Nafi bin Aasim ne unhen khabar di, ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Amr ko suna, unhon ne apne ek bhatije se jo Wahat se nikla tha kaha: Kya tumhare mazdoor kaam karte hain, us ne kaha: Main nahin janta, unhon ne kaha: Agar tum Saqafi hote to zaroor jante ke tumhare mazdoor kya kaam karte hain, phir hamari taraf mutawajjah hue to farmaya: Beshak aadmi jab apne mazdooron ke sath apne ghar mein kaam kare, aur Abu Aasim ne ek martaba kaha: apne maal mein, to wo Allah azza wa jalla ke kaam karne walon mein se ek kaam karne wala hota hai."
"449","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, mujh se Ibn Abi Zinad ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abdur Rahman al Aaraj se, Abu Huraira se, Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim nahin hogi yahan tak ke log imaraton mein ek dusre se barh charh kar uncha banane lagen."
"450","Abdullah ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Huraith bin Saaib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hasan ko kehte hue suna: Main Usman bin Affan ki khilafat mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki azwaj ke gharon mein dakhil hota tha to apne hath se un ki chhaton ko chu leta tha."
"451","Aur usi sanad ke sath Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Dawood bin Qais ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine hujre dekhe khajoor ki tehniyon se bane hue bahar se balon ke taton se dhake hue, aur mera khayal hai ke hujre ke darwaze se ghar ke darwaze tak ghar ka arz chhe ya saat haath ke qareeb tha, aur andar wale ghar ka andaza das haath lagata hun, aur mera khayal hai ke us ki unchai saat aur aath ke darmiyan isi ke qareeb thi, aur main Ayesha ke darwaze par ruka to wo maghrib ki taraf rukh kiye hue tha."
"452","Aur usi sanad ke sath Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Masada ne humen khabar di, Abdullah Rumi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Umm Talaq ke han dakhil hua to maine kaha: Tumhare is ghar ki chhat kitni past hai, unhon ne kaha: Aye mere bete beshak Ameerul Momineen Umar bin Khattab raziyallahu anhu ne apne aamilon ko likha: Apni imaraten buland na karo, pas beshak ye tumhare badtareen dinon mein se hai."
"453","Sulaiman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jareer bin Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya, Aamash se, Sallam bin Shurahbeel se, Habba bin Khalid aur Sawa bin Khalid se, ke wo dono Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aye jabke Aap apni ek deewar ya imarat par kaam kar rahe the, to un dono ne Aap ki madad ki."
"454","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shoba ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail bin Abi Khalid se, Qais bin Abi Hazim se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Khabbab ke pas un ki ayadat ke liye dakhil hue jabke unhon ne saat dagh lagwaye the, to unhon ne kaha: Beshak hamare jo sathi guzar chuke wo guzar gaye aur duniya ne unhen kuch kam nahin kiya, aur beshak hum ne maal paya jis ke liye mitti ke siwa koi thikana nahin pate, aur agar Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne humen maut ki dua mangne se mana na farmaya hota to main zaroor us ki dua mangta."
"455","Phir hum dusri martaba un ke pas aye jabke wo apni ek deewar bana rahe the, to unhon ne kaha: Beshak musalman ko har cheez mein ajr diya jata hai jo wo kharch karta hai siwae us cheez ke jo wo mitti mein lagata hai."
"456","Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Safar ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam guzre jabke main apne liye ek chhappar durust kar raha tha, to Aap ne farmaya: ye kya hai, main ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, main apna chhappar durust kar raha hun, to Aap ne farmaya: maamla is se zyada tez hai."
"457","Abu Nuaim aur Qabisa ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib bin Abi Sabit se, Khamail se, Nafi bin Abdul Haris se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai Aap ne farmaya: aadmi ki khush bakhti me se hai khula maskan, aur nek hamsaya, aur pur sukoon sawari."
"458","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zahhak bin Nibras Abul Hasan ne hum se bayan kiya, Sabit se, ke woh Zawiya me Anas ke sath un ke ek bala khane ke upar thay, pas unhon ne azan suni, to woh utre aur main bhi utra, to unhon ne qadam qareeb qareeb rakhe, pas farmaya: main Zaid bin Sabit ke sath tha to unhon ne mujhe is tarah chalaya aur kaha: kya tum jante ho main ne tumhare sath aisa kyun kiya, kyunke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe is tarah chalaya tha aur farmaya tha: kya tum jante ho main ne tumhe is tarah kyun chalaya hai, main ne kaha: Allah aur Us ka Rasul zyada jante hain, Aap ne farmaya: taake namaz ki talab me hamare qadmon ki tadad zyada ho."
"459","Abdur Rahman bin Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Abi al-Fudaik ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Abi Yahya ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Hind se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke log aise ghar banayenge jinhe woh marahil jaisa banayenge, Ibrahim ne kaha: yani dhari dar kapde."
"460","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Malik bin Umair ne hum se bayan kiya, Mughira ke katib Warrad se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Muawiya ne Mughira ko likha: mujhe woh likh bhejo jo tum ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna hai, to unhon ne unhe likha: Nabiullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam har namaz ke peeche ye kaha karte thay: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi, Woh akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahi, Usi ke liye badshahat hai aur Usi ke liye tareef hai, aur Woh har cheez par qadir hai, Ae Allah, jo Tune ata kiya use rokne wala koi nahi, aur jo Tune rok liya use dene wala koi nahi, aur kisi daulat mand ki daulat Tere samne use faida nahi deti, aur unhe likha: Aap qeel o qaal se, aur kasrat se sawal karne se, aur maal zaya karne se mana karte thay, aur Aap maaon ki nafarmani se, aur betiyon ko zinda dafn karne se, aur rokne aur mangne se mana karte thay."
"461","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zib ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed al-Maqburi se, Abu Huraira se unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tum me se kisi ko us ka amal nijaat na dega, Sahaba ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, kya aap ko bhi nahi, Aap ne farmaya: mujhe bhi nahi, magar ye ke Allah mujhe apni taraf se rehmat me dhaanp le, pas seedhi rah ikhtiyar karo aur qareeb raho aur subah aur shaam amal karo, aur raat ke kuch hisse me bhi, aur darmiyana ravi ikhtiyar karo, darmiyana ravi, tum manzil ko pahunch jaoge."
"462","Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Saad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Urwa bin Zubair se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zauja Aisha se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Yahudiyon ka ek giroh Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas dakhil hua to unhon ne kaha: tum par maut ho, Aisha ne kaha to main us baat ko samajh gayi to main ne kaha: tum par hi maut aur lanat ho, unhon ne kaha: to Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: thehro Ae Aisha, beshak Allah har kaam me narmi ko pasand karta hai, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, kya Aap ne nahi suna jo unhon ne kaha tha, Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: main ne keh diya tha: aur tum par."
"463","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Aamash se, Tamim bin Salama se, Abdur Rahman bin Hilal se, Jarir bin Abdullah se unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jo narmi se mehrum kiya gaya woh bhalai se mehrum kiya gaya."
